CsvColAssignNote = Free-text note on the assignment.
CsvRuleAssignWarehouse = Import into the same warehouse you exported from: level columns must match that warehouse's levels.
CsvRuleAssignMatch = A product + lot already assigned is updated; a new one is created.
CsvRuleAssignClear = An empty level cell clears that level. A row with every level empty removes the assignment.
CsvRuleAssignValues = A dropdown value that is not allowed yet is an error, unless "Create missing dropdown values" is ticked.
