SheetSuggestedBin = Suggested (product's bin here)
SheetNoBinAssigned = No bin assigned
SheetBinElsewhere = Has a bin in: %s
SheetNoStock = No stock available
SheetShortStock = Not enough stock for the rest
SheetNoStockHere = No stock in this warehouse
SheetShortStockHere = Not enough stock in this warehouse for the rest
SheetStockHere = %s in stock here
SheetOtherLocations = %s other location(s)
SheetNoWarehouse = No warehouse
SheetNothingToList = Nothing to pick or place.
SheetButtonHint = Generates the sheet and opens it. It is also kept in the Documents block below, where it can be regenerated or emailed.
SheetGenerateFailed = Could not generate the sheet: %s
SheetStockAlreadyMoved =Stock for this shipment has already left the warehouse. Lot/serial bin assignments may have been cleared; bins shown as suggested come from the product's other assignments.
